      "functional_impact_measured": "Surface HA labeling in intact (non-permeabilized) hippocampal neurons at 21 DIV confirmed somato-dendritic plasma-membrane targeting of both NKCC1a and NKCC1b bearing the tag; the majority of the ECL2 epitope tag is labeled in intact cells, showing effective processing and delivery to the plasma membrane. Ion-transport function was NOT MEASURED for the tagged construct in the cited studies.",
